  "_doc": [
    "Seed for the Notion SDK's offline test mode, handed to NotionSDK.test() as",
    "{entity: {page: {<id>: <record>}}}. The seed key field of `page` is `id`, as",
    "the SDK's own resolver derives it. Each record is a page object as the API",
    "answers it under Notion-Version 2022-06-28: its title is the property of type",
    "`title`, its parent a database, a page or the workspace, its times RFC 3339",
    "text. A page is read without its blocks, so nothing here is a body."
